  "lists": [
    {
      "id": "1c7b07a3-8aa4-4c54-93c7-4cea40d0df16",
      "title": "Backlog",
      "cards": [
        {
          "id": "5aee355d-7fcb-4597-9d25-e0e014d9b9b9",
          "listId": "1c7b07a3-8aa4-4c54-93c7-4cea40d0df16",
          "title": "Use Result pattern in Invoice billing and TenantPricing",
          "description": "InvoiceService and BillingService and TenantPricingService should use the Result pattern to return the result of the operation. this way we can return more information about the error if something goes wrong and we can also return warnings if there are any.\n\ncode/libs/Libs/Result/Result.cs",
          "labels": [
            {
              "id": "2633c7da-7d04-4a38-8239-148cb27a04d3",
              "title": "Easy",
              "color": "#61bd4f"
            }
          ],
          "checkboxes": [],
          "comments": []
        },
        {
          "id": "3551b1e4-bc2b-4598-a6aa-f636876d3a29",
          "listId": "1c7b07a3-8aa4-4c54-93c7-4cea40d0df16",
          "title": "Use AutoMapper in Invoice, billing and TenantPricing",
          "description": "Invoice Service and Billing Service and TenantPricingService should use AutoMapper to map the entities to the models and vice versa. this will make the code cleaner and easier to maintain.\n",
          "labels": [
            {
              "id": "2633c7da-7d04-4a38-8239-148cb27a04d3",
              "title": "Easy",
              "color": "#61bd4f"
            }
          ],
          "checkboxes": [],
          "comments": []
        },
        {
          "id": "c94e855f-3145-40ea-a371-c46486515472",
          "listId": "1c7b07a3-8aa4-4c54-93c7-4cea40d0df16",
          "title": "Invoice controller xml documentation",
          "description": "we should add xml docs to the invoice controller and also add swagger documentation for the endpoints. this will make it easier for the customers to understand how to use the endpoints and what data they need to send.\n",
          "labels": [
            {
              "id": "2633c7da-7d04-4a38-8239-148cb27a04d3",
              "title": "Easy",
              "color": "#61bd4f"
            }
          ],
          "checkboxes": [],
          "comments": []
        },
        {
          "id": "b2da308b-18ac-4255-8bfe-4e76172099d8",
          "listId": "1c7b07a3-8aa4-4c54-93c7-4cea40d0df16",
          "title": "CORS Cache invalidation is too aggressive",
          "description": "When we make any change to a project key we clear the cache of the allowed origins for CORS. this is too aggressive and can cause performance issues if we have a lot of changes to the project keys.\n\nWe should edit the cache content instead of clearing it. so if we add a new origin we just add it to the cache and if we remove an origin we just remove it from the cache.\n",
          "labels": [
            {
              "id": "f11a1ada-0c6d-4dd0-b8df-6ca9b8d927c0",
              "title": "50+ Customers",
              "color": "#ff9f1a"
            },
            {
              "id": "15b727f4-2078-4524-804c-9b0e0d60c398",
              "title": "Semi-Complex",
              "color": "#ff9f1a"
            }
          ],
          "checkboxes": [],
          "comments": []
        },
        {
          "id": "0477eb51-0e1b-47d9-9f83-ec9962307fab",
          "listId": "1c7b07a3-8aa4-4c54-93c7-4cea40d0df16",
          "title": "Checking usage and applying limits",
          "description": "We will have a cronjob that will run every day at midnight and will check the usage of each tenant and will apply the limits based on their pricing tier.\n",
          "labels": [],
          "checkboxes": [],
          "comments": []
        },
        {
          "id": "0e3747f8-43e5-473d-9cf1-b4ededd53048",
          "listId": "1c7b07a3-8aa4-4c54-93c7-4cea40d0df16",
          "title": "Ingestion Idempotency",
          "description": "  - The pipeline is idempotency-aware in billing but not in metric ingestion (no dedupe) — could be a blog post on “where we chose to accept duplicates vs enforce idempotency” and why.",
          "labels": [
            {
              "id": "15b727f4-2078-4524-804c-9b0e0d60c398",
